  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_024 (multiprofile, scgpt+imagenet_vit_l, transformer+weighted) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.5199). This experiment tests a similar multiprofile setup with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (key components of the top performer) but swaps RNA encoder to pca_n2000 and image encoder to resnet50. This clarifies whether the high performance is due to specific encoder choices or the aggregation/fusion strategy. Since the budget prioritizes exploitation of promising directions, testing a closely related configuration with different encoders risks confirming or refuting the importance of these components."
